{"fps": 30, "frames": 1681, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 181, "text": "In nineteen-oh-seven, a banker locked New York's bankers in his library and kept the key.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "nineteen-oh-seven,", "f": 7, "e": 43}, {"w": "a", "f": 45, "e": 46}, {"w": "banker", "f": 48, "e": 57}, {"w": "locked", "f": 59, "e": 69}, {"w": "New", "f": 71, "e": 73}, {"w": "York's", "f": 75, "e": 85}, {"w": "bankers", "f": 88, "e": 98}, {"w": "in", "f": 99, "e": 101}, {"w": "his", "f": 103, "e": 105}, {"w": "library", "f": 107, "e": 123}, {"w": "and", "f": 128, "e": 133}, {"w": "kept", "f": 135, "e": 139}, {"w": "the", "f": 142, "e": 144}, {"w": "key.", "f": 146, "e": 169}]}, {"a": 181, "b": 323, "text": "Imagine you're a young broker, buying stocks with money borrowed by the day.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 183, "e": 197}, {"w": "you're", "f": 198, "e": 201}, {"w": "a", "f": 203, "e": 205}, {"w": "young", "f": 206, "e": 213}, {"w": "broker,", "f": 215, "e": 235}, {"w": "buying", "f": 238, "e": 245}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 247, "e": 258}, {"w": "with", "f": 261, "e": 263}, {"w": "money", "f": 267, "e": 274}, {"w": "borrowed", "f": 279, "e": 288}, {"w": "by", "f": 290, "e": 293}, {"w": "the", "f": 295, "e": 296}, {"w": "day.", "f": 297, "e": 315}]}, {"a": 323, "b": 476, "text": "Then a copper gamble blows up, and depositors stampede a trust company.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 325, "e": 334}, {"w": "a", "f": 341, "e": 345}, {"w": "copper", "f": 347, "e": 354}, {"w": "gamble", "f": 359, "e": 368}, {"w": "blows", "f": 370, "e": 379}, {"w": "up,", "f": 382, "e": 393}, {"w": "and", "f": 394, "e": 395}, {"w": "depositors", "f": 398, "e": 416}, {"w": "stampede", "f": 418, "e": 434}, {"w": "a", "f": 435, "e": 437}, {"w": "trust", "f": 439, "e": 446}, {"w": "company.", "f": 448, "e": 469}]}, {"a": 476, "b": 613, "text": "Nobody will lend. One-day money costs a hundred percent a year.", "words": [{"w": "Nobody", "f": 478, "e": 489}, {"w": "will", "f": 491, "e": 49